You would have to build your own [custom widget](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/documentation/#custom-widgets):

```js
var customWidget = {
  init: function(options) {
    $('x').onClick(function() {
      options.helper.setQueryParameter('restrictSearchableAttributes', ...);
    });
  }
};

search.addWidget(customWidget);
```

